# Build output
build/
build-*/

# Toolchain redirection used during development (Qt caches, XDG dirs, logs).
.toolchain/

# Development scratch: probes, a sandboxed DSH home, diagnostics.
# None of this is part of the client.
_spike/
_scratch/

# Credentials, wherever they end up. The sandbox home under _spike/ already
# holds a copy of the real .credentials.yaml (staged there by hand so the
# sandboxed tests can authenticate); _spike/ is ignored, but this rule is a
# second line of defence in case the sandbox is ever moved.
.credentials.yaml
.credentials.yml
*.credentials.yaml
secrets.json

# Editor/OS noise
*.swp
*.user
.DS_Store

# Coordinator worktrees: one per parallel work item. Scratch, not source.
.work/

# Project-local agent instructions: on disk, never in the repository.
# The other repos on this box all keep theirs untracked this way.
/AGENTS.md
